      "side": 1,
      "message": "As per guidelines we should return a NullPointerException by using requireNonNull\n\ngo/android-api-guidelines#nullability:\n\n```\nNullability enforcement\nIn Java, methods are recommended to perform input validation for @NonNull\nparameters via Objects.requireNonNull() and throw a NullPointerException when the\nparameters are null. This is automatically performed in Kotlin.\n```",
